<note style="-uslm-lc:I74" topic="amendments" id="id0e0317ac-810c-11f1-b7ce-bdea3d14cbdd"><heading class="centered smallCaps">Amendments</heading><p style="-uslm-lc:I21" class="indent0">2006—Par. (2). <ref href="/us/pl/109/363">Pub. L. 109–363</ref> inserted “Canada,” after “United States,”.</p>
</note>
